  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.49 Shower room",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.49 “Shower room” means a room between the clean room and the equipment room in the worker decontamination enclosure with running water that is suitably arranged for complete showering during decontamination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
